Regarding the BBcode vs. Filtered text formats... Filtered gets you the WYSIWYG editor and more of a view of how your post will look. Personally, that's pretty much all I use.&nbsp;

The smileys, yes, I know. You do get attached to them&nbsp; :sunglasses: . Whether they appear or not is up for discussion. I'll keep looking around. :)

--Joel

*UPDATE: Aug 19 2012* &nbsp;You can now use BBCode in the "Filtered Text" inside the WYSIWYG editor. There should be no need to switch.

